{"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"SwiftAgent"}],"title":"Safe Swift REPL & RAG Context Generator","roleHeading":"API Collection","role":"collectionGroup"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiftAgent\/documentation\/SwiftAgent"]]},"kind":"article","schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"seeAlsoSections":[{"anchor":"Guides--Tutorials","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiftAgent\/documentation\/SwiftAgent\/MultiAgentCollaboration"],"title":"Guides & Tutorials","generated":true}],"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Execute dynamic Swift expressions in a sandboxed evaluation engine, trace immutable lineage audit trails, and summarize tabular DataFrame context for local LLM agents."}],"topicSections":[{"title":"Agent Components","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiftAgent\/documentation\/SwiftAgent\/SwiftAgentEvaluator","doc:\/\/SwiftAgent\/documentation\/SwiftAgent\/RAGContextGenerator","doc:\/\/SwiftAgent\/documentation\/SwiftAgent\/LineageRecord","doc:\/\/SwiftAgent\/documentation\/SwiftAgent\/AgentError","doc:\/\/SwiftAgent\/documentation\/SwiftAgent\/AgentCommand"],"anchor":"Agent-Components"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Autonomous AI data analyst agents require two core capabilities when interacting with private local data:"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Sandboxed Code & Command Execution"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Safely filtering, grouping, projecting, and transforming tabular datasets without executing arbitrary unvetted shell scripts or system processes."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Token-Efficient Context Summarization"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": Compressing high-dimensional tables into structured, dense Markdown schema summaries that fit comfortably within LLM context windows."}]}]}],"type":"orderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SwiftAgent"},{"type":"text","text":" provides "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftAgent\/documentation\/SwiftAgent\/SwiftAgentEvaluator","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftAgent\/documentation\/SwiftAgent\/RAGContextGenerator","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" to bridge on-device large language models ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SwiftLLM"},{"type":"text","text":") with the native performance of "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/nodibell.github.io\/SwiftSci\/documentation\/swiftdataframe\/","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"mermaid","code":["graph TD","    UserQuery[User Analytics Query] --> LLM[Local LLM Agent \/ ReAct Engine]","    DF[(SwiftDataFrame In-Memory Table)] --> RAGGen[RAGContextGenerator]","    RAGGen --> PromptCtx[Markdown Dataset Profile]","    PromptCtx --> LLM","    LLM --> DSLCommand[Generated DSL Command e.g. 'filter age > 30']","    DSLCommand --> Evaluator[SwiftAgentEvaluator Actor]","    DF --> Evaluator","    Evaluator --> TransformedDF[Transformed DataFrame Output]","    Evaluator --> LineageRecord[Lineage Record Audit Trail]","    TransformedDF --> LLMResponse[Agent Synthesizes Final Answer]"]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"anchor":"1-Sandboxed-REPL--DSL-Command-Evaluation","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"1. Sandboxed REPL & DSL Command Evaluation"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftAgent\/documentation\/SwiftAgent\/SwiftAgentEvaluator","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" is an actor-isolated engine that parses and executes high-level DSL commands on a "},{"code":"DataFrame","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". Unlike raw interpreter bridges, it evaluates operations through a strongly typed AST (Abstract Syntax Tree), ensuring that memory safety, thread isolation, and data invariants are strictly preserved."}]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Supported DSL Operations","anchor":"Supported-DSL-Operations"},{"type":"table","header":"row","alignments":["left","left","left","left"],"rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Command Pattern"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Example Expression"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"AST Case"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Description"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Filter"}]}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"\"filter Age > 30.0\"","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".filter(column, condition)","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Evaluates scalar thresholds ("},{"code":">","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"<","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":">=","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"<=","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"==","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"!=","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Select"}]}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"\"select Product, Price\"","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".select(columns)","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Projects specific column subsets."}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"GroupBy"}]}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"\"groupby Category mean Price\"","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".groupBy(column, agg, target)","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Computes aggregations ("},{"code":"mean","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"sum","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"min","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"max","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"count","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Sample"}]}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"\"sample 50\"","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".sample(n)","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Randomly samples rows deterministically."}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Head \/ Tail"}]}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"\"head 10\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" \/ "},{"code":"\"tail 5\"","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".head(n)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" \/ "},{"code":".tail(n)","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Slices initial or trailing records."}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Null Handling"}]}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"\"dropNulls\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" \/ "},{"code":"\"fillNulls Fare 0.0\"","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".dropNulls","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" \/ "},{"code":".fillNulls","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Cleans or imputes missing scalar entries."}],"type":"paragraph"}]]]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Execution Example","anchor":"Execution-Example"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["import Foundation","import SwiftDataFrame","import SwiftAgent","","\/\/ 1. Initialize DataFrame","let rawDF = DataFrame(columns: [","    TypedColumn(name: \"Department\", values: [\"Sales\", \"Engineering\", \"Sales\", \"Support\", \"Engineering\"]),","    TypedColumn(name: \"Salary\", values: [75000.0, 120000.0, 82000.0, 58000.0, 135000.0]),","    TypedColumn(name: \"TenureYears\", values: [3, 5, 4, 1, 7])","])","","\/\/ 2. Initialize actor evaluator","let evaluator = SwiftAgentEvaluator()","","\/\/ 3. Execute sandboxed transformations","let highEarners = try await evaluator.evaluate(","    command: \"filter Salary >= 80000.0\",","    on: rawDF",")","","let departmentSummary = try await evaluator.evaluate(","    command: \"groupby Department mean Salary\",","    on: highEarners",")","","print(departmentSummary.summary())"]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"2. Lineage Tracking & Immutable Audit Trails","anchor":"2-Lineage-Tracking--Immutable-Audit-Trails"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When autonomous agents transform datasets over iterative multi-turn dialogues, tracking the provenance and step-by-step delta of the data is critical for compliance and verification."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftAgent\/documentation\/SwiftAgent\/SwiftAgentEvaluator","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" automatically captures each successful transformation as an immutable "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftAgent\/documentation\/SwiftAgent\/LineageRecord","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":":"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["\/\/ Inspect the execution trajectory","let auditTrail = await evaluator.lineage","","for record in auditTrail {","    print(\"\"\"","    [Step \\(record.stepIndex)] \\(record.operation)","      • Rows: \\(record.inputRows) -> \\(record.outputRows)","      • Executed At: \\(record.timestamp)","    \"\"\")","}","","\/\/ Reset trajectory between separate user tasks","await evaluator.clearLineage()"]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"3. Tabular RAG Context Summarization","anchor":"3-Tabular-RAG-Context-Summarization"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Large datasets cannot be pasted verbatim into an LLM context window without incurring prohibitive attention computation and context exhaustion. "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftAgent\/documentation\/SwiftAgent\/RAGContextGenerator","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" extracts metadata, column typings, and dimensional boundaries to produce token-efficient Markdown profiles for prompt injection:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let contextGen = RAGContextGenerator()","let markdownProfile = contextGen.generateSummary(df: rawDF, name: \"EmployeePayroll\")","","print(markdownProfile)","\/\/ Output:","\/\/ ## EmployeePayroll Profile","\/\/ - Rows: 5, Columns: 3","\/\/ - Columns: Department, Salary, TenureYears"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Inject this profile directly into your system prompt so the language model understands available columns and schema constraints before generating transformation instructions."}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"4. End-to-End LLM Function Calling & ReAct Integration","anchor":"4-End-to-End-LLM-Function-Calling--ReAct-Integration"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Combine "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftAgent\/documentation\/SwiftAgent\/RAGContextGenerator","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftAgent\/documentation\/SwiftAgent\/SwiftAgentEvaluator","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":", and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SwiftLLM"},{"type":"text","text":" to construct an autonomous tabular analyst:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["import SwiftAgent","import SwiftDataFrame","","public struct TabularAnalystTool: Sendable {","    private let evaluator: SwiftAgentEvaluator","    private var currentDataFrame: DataFrame","","    public init(df: DataFrame) {","        self.evaluator = SwiftAgentEvaluator()","        self.currentDataFrame = df","    }","","    \/\/\/ Tool invocation callback conforming to ReActAgent tool schema","    public mutating func execute(command: String) async throws -> String {","        let transformed = try await evaluator.evaluate(command: command, on: currentDataFrame)","        self.currentDataFrame = transformed","        return \"Command succeeded. Result dimensions: \\(transformed.rowCount) rows x \\(transformed.columnNames.count) columns.\"","    }","","    public func datasetContext() -> String {","        RAGContextGenerator().generateSummary(df: currentDataFrame, name: \"ActiveWorkspace\")","    }","}"]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"5. Safe Error Handling & Guardrails","anchor":"5-Safe-Error-Handling--Guardrails"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The evaluation sandbox rejects unparseable strings, missing columns, or type mismatches early, throwing structured "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftAgent\/documentation\/SwiftAgent\/AgentError","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" instances:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["do {","    let result = try await evaluator.evaluate(command: \"filter NonExistentCol > 10\", on: rawDF)","} catch let AgentError.unparseable(cmd) {","    print(\"Agent emitted an invalid DSL syntax: \\(cmd)\")","} catch let AgentError.executionFailed(reason) {","    print(\"Execution rejected: \\(reason)\")","} catch {","    print(\"Unexpected error: \\(error)\")","}"]},{"type":"thematicBreak"}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/swiftagent\/agenticreplandrag"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/SwiftAgent\/documentation\/SwiftAgent\/AgenticReplAndRAG"},"references":{"doc://SwiftAgent/documentation/SwiftAgent/RAGContextGenerator":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"RAG Context summary generator for dataframes."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftAgent\/documentation\/SwiftAgent\/RAGContextGenerator","title":"RAGContextGenerator","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"RAGContextGenerator","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"RAGContextGenerator","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swiftagent\/ragcontextgenerator","type":"topic","role":"symbol"},"doc://SwiftAgent/documentation/SwiftAgent/AgentError":{"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"AgentError","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftAgent\/documentation\/SwiftAgent\/AgentError","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Errors thrown by SwiftAgent evaluation sandbox."}],"fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AgentError","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swiftagent\/agenterror","role":"symbol","title":"AgentError"},"doc://SwiftAgent/documentation/SwiftAgent/AgentCommand":{"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"AgentCommand","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftAgent\/documentation\/SwiftAgent\/AgentCommand","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Structured Agent AST representation for sandboxed execution."}],"fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AgentCommand","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swiftagent\/agentcommand","type":"topic","role":"symbol","title":"AgentCommand"},"https://nodibell.github.io/SwiftSci/documentation/swiftdataframe/":{"identifier":"https:\/\/nodibell.github.io\/SwiftSci\/documentation\/swiftdataframe\/","url":"https:\/\/nodibell.github.io\/Sw